  "query": "-- A partition's retained blocks after a sequence, in chain order.\nSELECT b.partition, b.sequence, b.head_hash, b.sealed_at, b.block\nFROM audit.block AS b\nWHERE b.partition = $1 AND b.sequence > $2\nORDER BY b.sequence\nLIMIT $3\n",
